WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.650
This sky-blue sky that stretches
as far as the eye can see...

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.530
It was just too bright for me to see.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.120
What exactly can I do once I become an idol?

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.540
Let's see, the map of the student dorms...

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.960
Is something the matter?

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:37.430
U-Um, do you go to Nijigasaki High School?

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.520
Thank you for the other day.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.690
Oh...

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.600
Are you by yourself?

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.480
Yes. I don't like being in crowds.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.150
I see.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.490
But would you mind me joining you for lunch?

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.110
Do as you please.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:06.040
I've always dreamed about eating this
ever since I lived in Switzerland!

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.130
<i>Buono!</i>

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.010
You came all the way to Japan just to eat that?

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.140
Huh? Oh, no. That's not the only--

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.270
I'm kidding.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.020
Oh...

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.980
You see, I came to Japan
to become a school idol.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.190
School idol?

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.530
When I was little, I was watching
videos of Japanese idols

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.950
and my heart felt all warm and fuzzy inside.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.540
So I always dreamed of becoming
an idol who can do that, too.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.120
And you came all the way to Japan for that?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.670
Impressive.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.710
Um...

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.630
Are you Karin Asaka-san?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:56.510
Y-Yes?

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.220
We always see you in magazines!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.800
We're huge fans!

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:02.640
Why, thank you.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:04.930
We'll keep cheering you on!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.980
You're a model?

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.150
Yes. I'm just a fashion magazine model.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.360
Wow...

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:18.610
Wanting to be an idol is rather impressive,
too. Let's both do our best.

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.450
Yeah!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:29.290
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.060
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:49.980
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.730
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:55.730
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:02:55.730 --> 00:03:00.110
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:05.620
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.830
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.420
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.580
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:19.380
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.050
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.260
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.930
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.390
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.730
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:35.110
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:38.320
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.740
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.410
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:49.450
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.710
They're both <i>buono</i>!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.920
I see your appetite is
as hearty as ever, Emma.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.090
Well, it's just all so good.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.100
Do you have your club again today?

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.270
Yup! We had even more people join,
so it's been really lively lately.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:16.480
And now that we decided to be solo idols,
everyone's been even more motivated.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.520
I see.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.400
I wish you could join, too, Karin-chan.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.200
You know that I don't like
being around too many people.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.200
Right...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.040
Well, I better get going.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.500
Karin-chan...?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.800
--There, there, there...
--Meow...

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:43.630
Patting you on the head like this
reminds me of Neve-chan.

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.630
Is that one of your friends in Switzerland?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.220
Nope. They're one of our baby goats back home.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.220
Baby goats?!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.470
You have goats back at your place?

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:57.020
Yup. When I was little,
I'd sing to our goats all the time.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.520
Wow, that takes me back.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.320
Emma-san, don't you ever feel
homesick being away from home?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.950
Yeah. But being with all of you

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.830
feels like I'm with all my
little brothers and sisters back home.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.160
It's always so lively and fun.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.910
That makes me... happy.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:19.840
I think my family's worried
if I'm doing okay in Japan though.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.710
It looks like everyone's here.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.010
You two took a while.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.470
What is it, Kasumi-chan?

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.970
Ladies, take a look at this.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.260
That's Ayumu's video!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:38.400
--I'm Ayumu Uehara and I'm a member of
the Nijigasaki High School Idol Club!
--Well, you see, the views on this video have skyrocketed lately.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.030
There are lots of comments, too.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.940
You're right...

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.490
So we have an idea.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.620
Why don't we all make
promotional videos as solo idols?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.700
Promotional videos?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.580
Yes.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:59.880
Introductions or showing off our talents.
Anything to show off our appeal.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.420
Wow, PVs, huh? That sounds fun!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.470
That'd be perfect to show your family,
wouldn't it, Emma-san?

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.180
What kind of PV should we make?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:13.140
Huh? What kind?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.330
Setsuna-chan's so cool.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.620
It's been played so many times.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.620
Yes, I'm honored.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.040
You did the editing for this, right, Rinari?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.960
Yeah. I got a lot of ideas from Yu-san.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.880
I didn't say much.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.170
What about yours, Kasumi-chan?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.800
Come on, Kasumin!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.260
Hello!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:56.310
Yup, of course Kasumi-chan is as cute as ever.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.640
Oho, Senpai.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.690
I see that you are a lady of culture, as well.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:03.900
If we can get our names out there even more with
this, performing a concert will not be a dream.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.070
We're counting on everyone to make PVs

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:09.450
overflowing with appeal
just like Kasumin's, okay?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:14.410
Appeal... I wonder what
I should concentrate on.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:18.000
Well... In your case...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.290
What?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.830
First you're smiling,
then you start crying suddenly,

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.250
then puff up your cheeks when you get angry.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.500
There's never a dull moment with you.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.340
Yu-chan, that doesn't make me
sound like an idol at all!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.720
See! That's exactly what I'm talking about!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.720
Oh, jeez!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.390
--Dang it, Yu-chan!
--You're always observing us.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.230
Not just Ayumu-chan, but all of us.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:45.150
And you're always researching stuff
about school idols, so it's been a huge help.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.320
I'm so obsessed with school idols right now.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.570
So I want to support all of you
as much as I can.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:58.620
Having our own personal cheer squad
makes me want to go all out.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:02.000
Agreed. I feel like I have to
work harder, as well.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.540
You really don't have to work
any harder, Setsuna-senpai.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.540
No, no. There's so much I need to work on.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:13.010
Aw, but if you try any harder,
it's going to affect my popularity!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.350
I think this basically sums you two up.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.140
Do you have an idea of what you
want to do for your PV, Emma-san?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.270
Like what kind of idol you strive to be?

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:29.900
I want to be an idol that can make people
feel all warm and fuzzy inside.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.690
That sounds just like you, Emma-san.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:36.200
But I don't know what kind
of idol that actually is.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.030
Feeling all warm and fuzzy inside...

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.490
I wonder how you visualize that.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:43.710
Kanata-chan needs her pillow right about now.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.620
Perhaps a novel that brings you to tears.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.840
For example, there's this story
about a girl and her puppy...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.300
Kasumin's special buns! What else?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.670
Anime, without a doubt!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.050
I think it's plushies for me.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.550
My grandma's <i>nuka</i> pickles!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.930
School idols, of course!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.560
We all really do have different answers.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.690
I think Emma-san's image is important here.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:06.940
Yeah.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.360
Hm...

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:13.530
Well, with acting, it broadens your imagination
when you actually wear costumes.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.280
In that case...

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.870
Huh? Costumes?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.540
Thank you so much!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.330
N-No problem.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:31.460
Way to go, Karin-chan. You've got connections.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.630
I just happened to be in the same class
as some of the club members.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.590
How's it going, Emma-san?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.640
Yup, it's perfect.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:48.150
Welcome home, my lady.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.730
Te-he.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.190
She's so cute...

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.150
Can I try a few others?

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.360
Of course!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.610
Shall we go watch the fireworks?

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.120
Heck yeah!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.410
Yay! Go, fight, win!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:08.370
Rawr! I'm Beary Verde! I'm gonna eat you up!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.790
My heart...

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:11.210
That's a costume, too?!

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.540
Yes.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.510
I wonder if this is what it feels like
to make people feel all warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:21.850
Say, what about this? I think it'd
look great on you, Emma.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.600
Wow, no wonder you're a model!
You've got great taste.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.310
Hey, Emma-san. Before you
change into your next outfit,

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:29.940
can I get a picture with you?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.110
Of course.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.730
Then I want one, too!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.190
Me, too!

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.320
Okay, Rinari. Get in the picture right here.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.110
Okay.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.660
Come on, Karin-chan. Get in the picture, too.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.950
Huh? Nah, I'm good.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.750
Aw, come on!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.880
Sorry, I have to go.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.880
Karin-chan...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.220
An interview?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.640
Yes, of course.

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.650
What I'm interested in?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.440
What I want to do on my days off?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.660
Yeah, right.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:28.910
Karin-chan.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.120
Emma?!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.250
Hang on.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.500
Sure.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.840
Come in.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.300
Oh, jeez. It's so cluttered again.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.390
You can just leave it.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.760
Thanks for everything today.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.770
Do you want to see
the pictures we took after that?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.310
Not right now.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.640
Okay...

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.650
Karin-chan.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.860
Are you interested in them?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:04.700
Then you should join the club!
It's so much fun!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.660
All of us are working so hard
to become school idols!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.370
I'm not interested at all.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.710
I just thought that magazine
could help you out, Emma.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.210
--But...
--I have my modeling work,

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.300
so I really don't have time
to be a school idol.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.840
You know that don't you?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.430
I see...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.770
You're always helping me out,

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.940
so I thought that we might
be able to do this together.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.310
I just want to support you
because you're working so hard.

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:40.280
But if I'm giving you
the wrong idea, I'll back off.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.030
Karin-chan?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.410
You can take that with you.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.620
Use it for some costume ideas, or whatever.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:48.620
Oh, and...

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.370
Don't invite me to the club anymore.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.420
Why?

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:07.680
Why did she get so mad?
Do you hate it that much?

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.810
I don't understand, Karin-chan...

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:17.440
Yup... Flowers and Emma-chan
are a perfect match.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.440
Huh? You don't need to change?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.740
We were going to start with her uniform
and then change into all kinds of outfits.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.650
All kinds?

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:30.490
We couldn't settle on one,
so we figured she could wear all of them.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.370
That might be interesting.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.370
We'll be able to see all of
the wonderful sides to Emma-san.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.580
Camera... Ready.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.340
Then let's get started.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.170
Ready... and action!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:47.260
I'm Emma Verde. A third-year at Nijigasaki
in the international exchange program.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.300
--I came to Japan all the way from Switzerland
to become a school idol.
--I wonder what's wrong with Emma-san.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.890
--I came to Japan all the way from Switzerland
to become a school idol.
--Maybe she's sleepy.

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.350
--Okay, I'm going to go change.
--How's it look?

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:56.640
--Okay, I'm going to go change.
--Good. She looks cute.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.940
--All right.
--Good. She looks cute.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.360
I'm not interested at all.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.330
She seemed like a completely different person.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.490
I wonder which one is the real...

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.450
Emma-san.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.460
What is it?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:20.290
Well, you were taking
a really long time to get changed.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.300
Are you okay? Are you not feeling well?

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:27.340
No... I'm sorry. I made you all worry.

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.970
Even though I just want to make everyone
feel all warm and fuzzy inside.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.640
--Emma-san?
--Oh, I'm fine.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.060
I should get changed. Just one sec.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.060
Sure.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.520
Hey, this is the newest issue.
Can I take a look?

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.690
Sure.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.120
This is...

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.000
Karin-chan...

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.040
Um, I'm really sorry.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.340
I have to go!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.680
My questionnaire...

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.850
Where could it have gone?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.020
E-Emma?!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.070
Come with me!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.160
Hey! What's with you?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.830
Hang out with me today. Please.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.670
H-Hey!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.160
I don't remember the last time
I had this much fun.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.620
Karin-chan.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:25.080
This is yours, right? It was
in the magazine you gave me.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.710
Is that how you really feel?

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.050
It says the thing that you're
most interested in is school idols.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.470
That's just...

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.760
Why didn't you tell me?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.980
Why did you act like you weren't interested?

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:44.690
Why did you keep those feelings locked up?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:49.860
Do you remember what I told you before?

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:55.610
I want to be an idol that can make
everyone feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:16:55.610 --> 00:17:02.120
But... I couldn't even make you feel like that
when you're the closest person to me.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:08.340
That might mean that I won't be able
to change how anyone else feels...

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.590
Emma...

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.510
It's been so long since I've seen you smile.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.470
I want you to smile even more, Karin-chan!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.470
I want to know even more about you, Karin-chan!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:32.030
When I started helping you out with the club...

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.320
...it was a lot of fun.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.080
All of you were heading towards one goal

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:44.250
while being worried,
butting heads, and laughing.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.750
Everything that I thought was dumb
and had been avoiding all this time...

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.460
...was all really fun.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:57.010
But that's not who I...
That's not who Karin Asaka is.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.760
I'm supposed to be the cool, mature one.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.680
That's me.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.890
I can't just...

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:10.150
You get it now, don't you?
This was all my fault.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.320
Not yours, Emma.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.820
I'm sure you'll be able to make everyone...

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.330
It's okay, Karin-chan.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.660
You can be whoever you want to be
as long as you're smiling.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.750
That's the best you.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.920
So... it'll be okay.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:43.060
Let me know how you're feeling
even more, Karin-chan.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:46.850
Tell me!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.330
I'm sure our dreams are waiting

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.960
For us right here

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:11.670
I want to go beyond the clear, blue sky

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:16.380
And tell you even more

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:27.930
Once the door of unknown fates

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.560
Finally opens up (It's so exciting)

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.110
A new world opens up before us

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.070
It's a bit scary but

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.280
This trunk is stuffed full

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.900
With memories

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:44.120
Let's hold onto it tightly

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.700
The feelings (within my heart)

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.290
Are starting to race (They are!)

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.790
It's really hard

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:57.050
To lie to them (Isn't it?)

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:59.590
Listen to your heart

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.180
Our dreams will awaken

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:05.100
Right here in this place

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.510
It's going to shine (And in that moment)

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.890
My hand's going to reach for it

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:12.480
I'm going to make it come true

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.400
No matter what happens from now on

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.780
I can't let go (Of these feelings)

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.070
Let's change them into courage

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.660
La Bella Patria

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:27.870
Please let this song reach you

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:44.550
Do you really think... I can be a school idol?

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.760
I'm pretty sure you already started being one

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.350
the moment you decided you wanted to do it.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.270
Yeah.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.040
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.920
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:25.760
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:28.550
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:32.520
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:39.150
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.440
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:45.900
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:54.000
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:58.380
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:01.460
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:05.970
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.590
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:11.850
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.020
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.310
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:28.860
What?!

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.620
Karin-senpai's going to be
a school idol now, too?

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:35.540
Yup! It's going to be even more fun
with Karin-chan around!

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:36.580
Sure is.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:39.750
Ah... I get to look forward to
supporting even more people!

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.000
Oh, jeez...

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:44.130
Welcome to the School Idol Club.

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:45.010
Thanks.

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:50.890
But are you going to be able to join the club
when you're already a model?

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:55.980
Sure. I'm going to strive to be a top model
and a top school idol, as well.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:05.990
Emma-san's PV views and
comments are growing a lot.

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:08.070
--Really?
--Wow, Emma-san!

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:12.660
My family back home called me, too.
They were super happy.

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.160
Then this is a huge success!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.830
But of course.

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.460
I shot it, after all.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.580
I'm going to shoot yours, Karin-chan!

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:23.590
I wouldn't have it any other way, Emma.

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:24.670
Yeah!

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:30.510
What's wrong, Rinari?

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.640
Nothing.
